1
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:52,460
=As Promised=

2
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:53,980
(Adapted from "The Villain's Guide to Love",
a story on Zhihu Yanyan)

3
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:56,900
=Episode 12=

4
00:01:01,980 --> 00:01:02,860
(Imperial Medical Service)

5
00:01:02,880 --> 00:01:04,640
Miss Xiaoyuan has been suffering
from excessive internal heat,

6
00:01:05,070 --> 00:01:06,230
and the pain in her mouth is unbearable.

7
00:01:06,310 --> 00:01:07,790
The Crown Prince is terribly worried.

8
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:08,640
Sir,

9
00:01:08,640 --> 00:01:09,430
is there anything we can do?

10
00:01:11,820 --> 00:01:12,740
(Watermelon Frost)

11
00:01:13,230 --> 00:01:13,950
This is

12
00:01:13,950 --> 00:01:15,510
a remedy specially prepared
by the Imperial Medical Service.

13
00:01:16,280 --> 00:01:17,470
(Watermelon Frost)
The Noble Consort has recently developed

14
00:01:17,470 --> 00:01:18,480
(Watermelon Frost)
mouth sores from internal heat.

15
00:01:18,870 --> 00:01:19,870
Blow this medicinal powder

16
00:01:20,280 --> 00:01:21,230
into the mouth.

17
00:01:21,870 --> 00:01:23,350
It's very effective for mouth sores.

18
00:01:25,280 --> 00:01:26,140
Thank you, sir.

19
00:01:26,140 --> 00:01:28,300
(Watermelon Frost)

20
00:01:28,300 --> 00:01:29,310
(Wenhua Hall)

21
00:01:29,310 --> 00:01:30,790
After the fireworks ended
that Lantern Festival night,

22
00:01:30,790 --> 00:01:31,710
you were nowhere to be found.

23
00:01:31,870 --> 00:01:33,870
I had men search
the entire Capital several times.

24
00:01:33,870 --> 00:01:35,510
Xiaoyuan, tell me.

25
00:01:35,950 --> 00:01:37,590
What exactly happened
these past few days?

26
00:01:38,280 --> 00:01:39,230
(If I tell him,)

27
00:01:39,480 --> 00:01:41,280
(he and Zhao Boqing
will turn against each other,)

28
00:01:41,540 --> 00:01:42,430
(and the court will fall into chaos.)

29
00:01:43,310 --> 00:01:44,790
(Great Yue
cannot withstand such turmoil.)

30
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:47,510
On the night of the Lantern Festival,

31
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:49,150
I was wounded by assassins.

32
00:01:49,510 --> 00:01:50,120
After that,

33
00:01:50,280 --> 00:01:51,920
I struggled to make it back home.

34
00:01:52,070 --> 00:01:53,950
But while I was recovering,

35
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:55,310
the assassins still managed to find me.

36
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:58,680
Just now, I was so disoriented

37
00:01:59,590 --> 00:02:00,790
that when I saw the Seventh Prince,

38
00:02:00,790 --> 00:02:02,350
I mistook him for the killer.

39
00:02:04,280 --> 00:02:05,350
I see.

40
00:02:05,790 --> 00:02:06,590
Yes.

41
00:02:07,310 --> 00:02:09,280
Boqing truly has no reason
to do such a thing.

42
00:02:12,360 --> 00:02:14,910
Now my parents and sister
are all dead because of me.

43
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:16,000
In this world,

44
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:18,400
I'm all alone.

45
00:02:19,560 --> 00:02:20,360
No.

46
00:02:21,560 --> 00:02:22,560
You still have me.

47
00:02:23,680 --> 00:02:24,710
While you were gone,

48
00:02:24,710 --> 00:02:26,120
I realized something.

49
00:02:26,910 --> 00:02:27,910
You're the only woman

50
00:02:27,910 --> 00:02:29,560
I want to spend
the rest of my life with.

51
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:30,870
Xiaoyuan,

52
00:02:32,280 --> 00:02:33,360
will you marry me

53
00:02:33,520 --> 00:02:34,590
and become my Crown Princess?

54
00:02:35,630 --> 00:02:36,870
Then I can rightfully

55
00:02:36,870 --> 00:02:38,080
protect you from every hardship

56
00:02:38,520 --> 00:02:40,000
and never let you suffer again.

57
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:41,240
(Perhaps)

58
00:02:41,750 --> 00:02:43,310
(I should never have
hoped for anything else.)

59
00:02:44,400 --> 00:02:45,280
(Marrying the Crown Prince)

60
00:02:46,470 --> 00:02:48,280
(is the fate Heaven has chosen for me.)

61
00:02:54,310 --> 00:02:55,000
Your Highness,

62
00:02:57,150 --> 00:02:57,960
I will.

63
00:03:00,560 --> 00:03:01,360
Good.

64
00:03:01,680 --> 00:03:02,470
That's wonderful.

65
00:03:04,600 --> 00:03:09,010
♪Drunk through three lifetimes,
never waking from the dream♪

66
00:03:09,180 --> 00:03:11,820
(Crown Prince Zhao Junyao and He Xiaoyuan
will wed on an auspicious day)

67
00:03:11,910 --> 00:03:13,470
He Xiaoyuan?

68
00:03:14,710 --> 00:03:16,470
Why does it have to be He Xiaoyuan?

69
00:03:19,400 --> 00:03:22,280
My entire Yu family has supported
his mother's clan for over twenty years.

70
00:03:22,870 --> 00:03:24,960
We've cleared
every obstacle from his path.

71
00:03:25,280 --> 00:03:26,590
Why?

72
00:03:27,190 --> 00:03:29,000
Why won't he ever love me?

73
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:29,560
Young Lady.

74
00:03:30,150 --> 00:03:30,430
Then...

75
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:32,400
are we still going to the wedding?

76
00:03:33,310 --> 00:03:34,120
Of course.

77
00:03:34,430 --> 00:03:35,470
Why wouldn't we?

78
00:03:36,680 --> 00:03:37,280
Bi.

79
00:03:38,080 --> 00:03:39,560
Get some men ready for me.

80
00:03:41,080 --> 00:03:42,430
The only woman he can marry

81
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:44,710
is me.

82
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:47,870
(Father.)

83
00:03:48,030 --> 00:03:48,590
(Mother.)

84
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:49,470
(Sister.)

85
00:03:50,240 --> 00:03:51,190
(This is all my fault.)

86
00:03:52,030 --> 00:03:53,710
(You shouldn't have had to suffer)

87
00:03:53,710 --> 00:03:55,840
(such horrific deaths over
and over because of my obsession.)

88
00:03:56,630 --> 00:03:57,470
(I'm sorry.)

89
00:03:58,560 --> 00:03:59,910
(Thankfully, in this lifetime,)

90
00:04:00,470 --> 00:04:01,840
(I won't insist on
having my way anymore.)

91
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:04,000
(I'll use this wedding dress)

92
00:04:04,470 --> 00:04:05,840
(to bring peace to the realm)

93
00:04:06,520 --> 00:04:08,520
(and let Zhao Boqing have what
he has always wanted.)

94
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:09,750
(This way,)

95
00:04:10,400 --> 00:04:11,280
(perhaps it's for the best.)

96
00:04:19,750 --> 00:04:20,560
Zhao Boqing.

97
00:04:21,160 --> 00:04:22,160
He Xiaoyuan.

98
00:04:22,800 --> 00:04:23,920
How could you be so heartless?

99
00:04:24,560 --> 00:04:25,430
Marry the Crown Prince?

100
00:04:25,600 --> 00:04:26,950
Did I agree to that?

101
00:04:27,310 --> 00:04:29,000
The auspicious hour has arrived.

102
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:32,160
May the groom
now enter the bridal chamber.

103
00:04:33,600 --> 00:04:34,480
Put me down!

104
00:04:34,480 --> 00:04:35,560
Put me down!

105
00:04:35,950 --> 00:04:36,510
Have you lost your mind?

106
00:04:36,510 --> 00:04:37,270
Let go of me!

107
00:04:38,950 --> 00:04:39,720
Let go of me!

108
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:41,240
Zhao Boqing!

109
00:04:42,360 --> 00:04:43,720
- (What perfect timing.)
- Let go of me!

110
00:04:44,270 --> 00:04:45,430
(I thought I'd have
to go to some trouble.)

111
00:04:45,430 --> 00:04:45,870
Put me down!

112
00:04:45,870 --> 00:04:47,800
(I never expected you
to run away from your own wedding.)

113
00:04:48,070 --> 00:04:49,190
(He Xiaoyuan,)

114
00:04:49,510 --> 00:04:50,870
(since you're not destined)

115
00:04:51,390 --> 00:04:52,920
(to become Crown Princess,)

116
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:54,480
(then the position
should rightfully be mine.)

117
00:05:07,750 --> 00:05:08,680
Put me down!

118
00:05:10,070 --> 00:05:10,950
Put me down!

119
00:05:12,870 --> 00:05:14,360
Zhao Boqing, have you lost your mind?

120
00:05:15,120 --> 00:05:16,390
I completed my task as promised

121
00:05:16,390 --> 00:05:17,310
and married the Crown Prince.

122
00:05:17,310 --> 00:05:18,920
You ascended the throne
according to your plan.

123
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:21,390
Isn't this everything
you've worked so hard for?

124
00:05:21,510 --> 00:05:23,190
What more do you want now?

125
00:05:23,480 --> 00:05:25,600
If everything had
truly gone the way I wanted,

126
00:05:25,720 --> 00:05:27,600
why would I have come
to steal you from your wedding?

127
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:30,800
Use your head and think about it.

128
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:31,680
I don't want to think about it!

129
00:05:33,160 --> 00:05:34,360
I was too foolish.

130
00:05:35,430 --> 00:05:37,510
Foolish enough to fall into your plans,

131
00:05:37,800 --> 00:05:40,680
foolish enough to get
my parents and sister killed.

132
00:05:40,950 --> 00:05:42,270
It's all my fault.

133
00:05:42,390 --> 00:05:44,310
Do you know how much I hate myself?

134
00:05:47,160 --> 00:05:49,240
But I truly hate you too.

135
00:05:54,920 --> 00:05:56,160
I hate you.

136
00:05:56,240 --> 00:05:57,480
I hate you!

137
00:06:00,020 --> 00:06:06,640
♪One thought waits for the snow,
shining bright in my memories♪

138
00:06:06,920 --> 00:06:12,690
♪Remembering a past life,
with no regrets for this chapter♪

139
00:06:13,060 --> 00:06:20,040
♪Can I still hope
that someday we'll meet again?♪

140
00:06:34,870 --> 00:06:40,920
♪One thought of those years,
both a dream and yet so real♪

141
00:06:41,840 --> 00:06:48,580
♪One thought waits for the snow,
shining bright in my memories♪

142
00:06:48,690 --> 00:06:51,220
♪Remembering a past life♪

143
00:06:52,160 --> 00:06:52,950
I'm sorry.

144
00:06:53,920 --> 00:06:54,800
I was wrong.

145
00:06:56,750 --> 00:06:57,870
It's all my fault.

146
00:06:58,430 --> 00:06:59,680
I also bear responsibility

147
00:07:00,360 --> 00:07:01,800
for your family's deaths.

148
00:07:05,240 --> 00:07:06,390
Once this is all over,

149
00:07:08,680 --> 00:07:09,750
I'll give you my life

150
00:07:11,510 --> 00:07:12,600
to repay them.

151
00:07:15,070 --> 00:07:16,270
You didn't kill them.

152
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:18,310
I don't want your life.

153
00:07:24,120 --> 00:07:25,270
I just don't understand.

154
00:07:25,600 --> 00:07:26,750
If Fu Yang

155
00:07:27,600 --> 00:07:28,920
really betrayed you,

156
00:07:30,160 --> 00:07:31,830
why didn't he simply kill me

157
00:07:31,830 --> 00:07:32,800
and destroy your path to the throne?

158
00:07:33,600 --> 00:07:35,000
Why spare my life

159
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:37,560
just to drive us apart?

160
00:07:39,360 --> 00:07:40,160
That day,

161
00:07:41,800 --> 00:07:43,430
I captured Fu Yang.

162
00:07:44,830 --> 00:07:46,480
The one who actually
carried out the massacre

163
00:07:46,830 --> 00:07:48,360
was Imperial Preceptor Zhixuan.

164
00:07:53,630 --> 00:07:54,510
I think

165
00:07:55,070 --> 00:07:56,720
this will give you the answers you want.

166
00:08:03,830 --> 00:08:04,630
That's right.

167
00:08:05,480 --> 00:08:06,800
Zhixuan is my biological father.

168
00:08:07,390 --> 00:08:09,480
We're descendants
of the former royal family.

169
00:08:10,630 --> 00:08:11,800
We spent ten years in hiding

170
00:08:12,190 --> 00:08:13,270
only to restore our dynasty.

171
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:16,000
Even becoming
Princess Yun Fang's Prince Consort

172
00:08:16,720 --> 00:08:18,360
was part of the plan.

173
00:08:19,360 --> 00:08:20,360
Unfortunately,

174
00:08:21,600 --> 00:08:22,870
He Xiaoyuan failed.

175
00:08:23,270 --> 00:08:25,560
My father had no choice
but to sacrifice years of his life

176
00:08:26,560 --> 00:08:28,560
to restart the cycle again and again.

177
00:08:28,950 --> 00:08:30,950
Perhaps by forcibly disrupting the stars

178
00:08:32,120 --> 00:08:34,600
and twisting the bond
meant for He Xiaoyuan and you

179
00:08:34,790 --> 00:08:36,670
into one between
her and the Crown Prince,

180
00:08:36,870 --> 00:08:38,550
he defied fate itself

181
00:08:39,550 --> 00:08:40,910
and was doomed to fail.

182
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:44,790
But your plan with the Imperial Preceptor
has already failed.

183
00:08:46,150 --> 00:08:47,840
Zhixuan didn't choose
to take everyone down with him.

184
00:08:48,870 --> 00:08:49,630
Instead,

185
00:08:49,630 --> 00:08:51,870
he drove He Xiaoyuan and me apart.

186
00:08:52,150 --> 00:08:53,360
You want to know

187
00:08:53,630 --> 00:08:54,750
why he didn't simply kill

188
00:08:54,750 --> 00:08:56,080
He Xiaoyuan as well, don't you?

189
00:08:56,550 --> 00:08:57,750
That's because

190
00:08:57,960 --> 00:08:59,510
you bear the destiny of Great Yue.

191
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:00,670
Among the three stars,

192
00:09:00,910 --> 00:09:02,720
the Pleiades
and the companion star must survive.

193
00:09:03,270 --> 00:09:05,270
Only the Kang star,
destined to fade, may die.

194
00:09:05,440 --> 00:09:07,840
Otherwise, even if we
eventually seized the realm,

195
00:09:08,480 --> 00:09:09,790
Great Yue's fortunes

196
00:09:09,790 --> 00:09:11,120
would soon decline.

197
00:09:11,240 --> 00:09:13,030
My father had no other choice.

198
00:09:13,030 --> 00:09:14,910
Just as I, a remnant
of the former dynasty,

199
00:09:16,720 --> 00:09:17,960
am destined in this life

200
00:09:19,870 --> 00:09:21,670
to do nothing but restore our dynasty.

201
00:09:22,720 --> 00:09:23,320
Is that so?

202
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:26,030
When I realized

203
00:09:26,150 --> 00:09:27,550
she was still alive,

204
00:09:28,870 --> 00:09:30,150
I was immensely relieved

205
00:09:31,720 --> 00:09:33,360
that your father hadn't chosen...

206
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:38,550
Fu Yang is actually
the Imperial Preceptor's son.

207
00:09:40,320 --> 00:09:42,960
They're both descendants
of the former royal family.

208
00:09:43,510 --> 00:09:44,630
So

209
00:09:44,630 --> 00:09:46,390
everything that happened
over these thirty-three lifetimes

210
00:09:47,960 --> 00:09:50,200
was all part of the Imperial Preceptor's
grand deception.

211
00:09:51,600 --> 00:09:52,440
No wonder.

212
00:09:53,720 --> 00:09:54,440
That day,

213
00:09:54,670 --> 00:09:56,960
I never wrote to the Crown Prince
asking him to come get me.

214
00:09:58,000 --> 00:09:59,390
Killing your family

215
00:10:00,120 --> 00:10:01,600
was meant to make you hate me.

216
00:10:02,550 --> 00:10:03,960
Having the Crown Prince come get you

217
00:10:04,480 --> 00:10:06,200
was meant to leave you
with no one else to turn to

218
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:08,150
and force you to marry
into the Eastern Palace.

219
00:10:08,960 --> 00:10:09,910
His true purpose

220
00:10:10,480 --> 00:10:11,840
was to tear apart

221
00:10:11,840 --> 00:10:13,550
the bond fate had destined for us

222
00:10:14,240 --> 00:10:15,760
and turn us completely
against each other.

223
00:10:16,910 --> 00:10:17,600
I'm sorry.

224
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:24,790
I'm sorry.

225
00:10:25,750 --> 00:10:26,480
Does it still hurt?

226
00:10:34,670 --> 00:10:36,270
It hurt that you didn't believe me.

227
00:10:39,510 --> 00:10:40,320
Yuan Yuan.

228
00:10:42,790 --> 00:10:45,200
Your parents and sister
will not have died in vain.

229
00:10:45,200 --> 00:10:48,080
I will kill them with my own hands

230
00:10:48,080 --> 00:10:49,360
and make them pay in blood.

231
00:10:51,720 --> 00:10:52,910
This endless cycle

232
00:10:53,200 --> 00:10:54,270
should be brought to an end

233
00:10:55,750 --> 00:10:57,000
by our own hands.

234
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:28,910
How could this happen?

235
00:11:30,360 --> 00:11:31,440
He Xiaoyuan

236
00:11:31,750 --> 00:11:33,120
clearly married the Crown Prince.

237
00:11:33,360 --> 00:11:34,240
How could they still...

238
00:11:45,390 --> 00:11:47,240
Zhao Boqing and He Xiaoyuan

239
00:11:48,910 --> 00:11:51,240
have ruined everything
I planned over thirty-three lifetimes.

240
00:11:52,670 --> 00:11:53,480
Bad news, sir!

241
00:11:53,480 --> 00:11:54,270
There's a notice posted
at the city gate.

242
00:11:54,270 --> 00:11:55,440
Fu Yang has been charged
with serious dereliction of duty

243
00:11:55,440 --> 00:11:56,460
and attempting
to murder the Seventh Prince.

244
00:11:56,630 --> 00:11:57,240
In three days,

245
00:11:57,240 --> 00:11:58,630
he'll be executed.

246
00:12:02,550 --> 00:12:04,320
That insolent brat!

247
00:12:06,030 --> 00:12:08,270
He's trying to force me to show myself.

248
00:12:18,500 --> 00:12:20,820
♪My longing has nowhere to rest♪

249
00:12:21,180 --> 00:12:22,860
♪Through the storm, I drift and sway♪

250
00:12:23,500 --> 00:12:26,500
♪You are the prayer I hold in my palm♪

251
00:12:27,020 --> 00:12:31,340
♪In one frozen moment,
my tears come into focus♪

252
00:12:31,340 --> 00:12:34,100
♪My heart has long known♪

253
00:12:34,540 --> 00:12:36,540
♪We made a promise long ago♪

254
00:12:36,860 --> 00:12:38,460
♪To stay together until the end of time♪

255
00:12:39,140 --> 00:12:42,460
♪You are the fate I cannot escape♪

256
00:12:42,780 --> 00:12:45,620
♪How much must I let go♪

257
00:12:45,940 --> 00:12:47,620
♪For one moment♪

258
00:12:47,900 --> 00:12:50,620
♪To hold each other close♪

259
00:12:50,860 --> 00:12:55,180
♪Would that be enough?♪
